{"name": "Tails & Talons", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something built the tower, and it wasn't kind. Every floor down, the walls remember older, hungrier things. But a crew of furry adventurers is headed to the bottom anyway, Arcane cards in hand, with a plan to hit harder than anything down there is expecting. Every card is an attack, a spell, or both. Chain them into poker-style combos and turn a scratch into a killing blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1788692776\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only 5 Elements and 4 Runes, powerful combos are always within reach. Match them up to rack up bigger and bigger numbers every attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.poster.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.webm?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/e158c04000aa6314ca2152411d6e4004.mp4?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1788692776\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matching-combos aren't the only way to hit hard. Fill your deck with spells and discover trinkets that synergise with your strategy to grow your power exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/2f44be0999f7454c4c143f5eff5e375b.poster.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/2f44be0999f7454c4c143f5eff5e375b.webm?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/2f44be0999f7454c4c143f5eff5e375b.mp4?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1788692776\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into a mysterious underground tower and face its increasingly twisted inhabitants.\u00a0Uncover its forbidden knowledge by documenting creatures, trinkets, and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.poster.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.webm?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/da231f19a29d8c222e473de148422a2b.mp4?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1788692776\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each furry hero brings their own personality and unique playstyle to the dungeon! The Meowgician racks up damage by chaining the same combo repeatedly, while the Haretic thrives on the edge of death, sacrificing their own health to hit prime numbers and trigger devastating damage bursts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.poster.avif?t=1788692776\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.webm?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cf23e6ed14e1242de6d3c474501daa7b.mp4?t=1788692776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The tower gets stronger. So does your hand. Every card is an attack, a spell, or both. Chain the right combo and turn a scratch into a killing blow. Play as one of a crew of furry adventurers who descend into an eldritch tower, each with their own reasons, one shared goal: reach the bottom.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/b9eaa6f4dd57e7bdb0cf87883066c2f4ecce6132/header.jpg?t=1788692776", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Deckbuilding", "Roguelite", "Card Battler", "Poker", "Strategy", "Roguelike Deckbuilder"], "developers": "RATH", "publishers": "RATH", "release_date": "Jan 8, 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3667460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Fb4k4TbMZ0g", "first_seen": 1788645600.0, "review_rank": 30}